{"kp_id": "zj-024.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-024", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "六阳经有原穴，阴经无原穴（与阴经以输代原相对）。冲阳为胃经原穴。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.st42", "concept.yuan_xue", "meridian.st"], "chapter_id": "zj-024.c01", "evidence_quote": "阳经上面才有原穴，阴经上面没有穴足", "seg_from": 14, "seg_to": 22, "start_s": 56.88, "end_s": 105.7, "citation": {"youtube_id": "HTqpLJ-qLI8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HTqpLJ-qLI8&t=56s", "series": "zj", "episode": 24, "title": "Ni Hai-sha \"Human Record\": Acupuncture, 90-Part Series - Acupuncture 24", "start_s": 56.88, "end_s": 105.7}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "穴足=原穴", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-024.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-024", "type": "contraindication", "statement": "昔日粗针易中动脉，冲阳常禁针；今细针可摸脉拨开后下针，虚实皆可用。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.st42"], "chapter_id": "zj-024.c01", "evidence_quote": "冲阳是竞争的", "seg_from": 25, "seg_to": 39, "start_s": 109.11, "end_s": 177.485, "citation": {"youtube_id": "HTqpLJ-qLI8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HTqpLJ-qLI8&t=109s", "series": "zj", "episode": 24, "title": "Ni Hai-sha \"Human Record\": Acupuncture, 90-Part Series - Acupuncture 24", "start_s": 109.11, "end_s": 177.49}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "竞争=禁针", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-024.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-024", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "冲阳脉搏动存在提示胃气尚在。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.st42", "zangfu.wei"], "chapter_id": "zj-024.c01", "evidence_quote": "冲阳麦有冲阳脉债就代表胃气还在", "seg_from": 32, "seg_to": 32, "start_s": 142.75, "end_s": 147.545, "citation": {"youtube_id": "HTqpLJ-qLI8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HTqpLJ-qLI8&t=142s", "series": "zj", "episode": 24, "title": "Ni Hai-sha \"Human Record\": Acupuncture, 90-Part Series - Acupuncture 24", "start_s": 142.75, "end_s": 147.54}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "麦/脉债=脉在", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-024.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-024", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "水气上泛面部可取陷谷；取穴在趾缝上约五分，勿贴骨下针。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.st43"], "chapter_id": "zj-024.c01", "evidence_quote": "你在陷股穴上下中都可以", "seg_from": 66, "seg_to": 100, "start_s": 298.93, "end_s": 461.5, "citation": {"youtube_id": "HTqpLJ-qLI8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HTqpLJ-qLI8&t=298s", "series": "zj", "episode": 24, "title": "Ni Hai-sha \"Human Record\": Acupuncture, 90-Part Series - Acupuncture 24", "start_s": 298.93, "end_s": 461.5}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "陷股=陷谷", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-024.kp0005", "video_id": "zj-024", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "内庭为胃经荥穴属水；厉兑为井穴属金，为阳明土经之子穴。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.st44", "acupoint.st45"], "chapter_id": "zj-024.c01", "evidence_quote": "内庭穴呢，它是胃经的溶穴", "seg_from": 104, "seg_to": 108, "start_s": 472.93, "end_s": 499.645, "citation": {"youtube_id": "HTqpLJ-qLI8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HTqpLJ-qLI8&t=472s", "series": "zj", "episode": 24, "title": "Ni Hai-sha \"Human Record\": Acupuncture, 90-Part Series - Acupuncture 24", "start_s": 472.93, "end_s": 499.64}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "溶穴=荥穴；止穴=子穴", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-024.kp0006", "video_id": "zj-024", "type": "treatment_principle", "statement": "下牙痛取足阳明胃经；上牙痛取禾髎、迎香等大肠经穴。", "entity_ids": ["meridian.st", "acupoint.li19", "acupoint.li20"], "chapter_id": "zj-024.c01", "evidence_quote": "下牙痛的时候，我们下足阳明味精上牙痛的时候", "seg_from": 140, "seg_to": 140, "start_s": 678.5, "end_s": 686.105, "citation": {"youtube_id": "HTqpLJ-qLI8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HTqpLJ-qLI8&t=678s", "series": "zj", "episode": 24, "title": "Ni Hai-sha \"Human Record\": Acupuncture, 90-Part Series - Acupuncture 24", "start_s": 678.5, "end_s": 686.11}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "味精=胃经", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-024.kp0007", "video_id": "zj-024", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "脾与胃互为表里：胃为表可见，脾为里；脾主四肢与肌肉，甘味入脾胃。", "entity_ids": ["zangfu.pi", "zangfu.wei", "concept.biao_li"], "chapter_id": "zj-024.c02", "evidence_quote": "胃呢是表脾呢是里", "seg_from": 241, "seg_to": 282, "start_s": 1230.561, "end_s": 1438.226, "citation": {"youtube_id": "HTqpLJ-qLI8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HTqpLJ-qLI8&t=1230s", "series": "zj", "episode": 24, "title": "Ni Hai-sha \"Human Record\": Acupuncture, 90-Part Series - Acupuncture 24", "start_s": 1230.56, "end_s": 1438.23}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
